{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂风穿刺"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击退1名敌人并为其添加“丛林印记”。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卡夫拉会优先攻击处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，“丛林印记”最多只会存在1个。使用终极技能时，卡夫拉为一名敌人添加“丛林印记”，对其造成迅猛绝伦的一击，造成500% + 50% ATK伤害，并击退2格。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至530% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至550% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","林间追猎"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","冲向1名敌人，造成伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人脱离自己的攻击范围，卡夫拉便会向其冲锋，造成280% ATK伤害，使其眩晕1.5 + 0.5秒。如果场上不存在处于“丛林印记”状态的敌人，卡夫拉会对最近目标施加“丛林印记”，并释放本技能。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至290% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至320% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","丛林之敌"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","降低携带“丛林印记”的敌人的护甲，并且在击败他时得到增益。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“丛林印记”能够降低敌人6%护甲，携带“丛林印记”的敌人被击败时，这名敌人周围2格内的友军每0.375秒回复-100% − 15% ATK生命值，持续1.125秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至9%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至12%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","下降护甲的幅度提升至15%。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","无情驱逐"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","有敌人治疗携带“丛林印记”的敌人时，对其进行突击。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","携带“丛林印记”的敌人受到来自其他敌人的治疗时，卡夫拉跳跃至治疗来源附近对其发起攻击，造成250% ATK伤害，并使其在5秒内降低40点急速。过程中卡夫拉处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":79,"end":81,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","施放本技能时，卡夫拉获得一个可以抵御350% ATK伤害的护盾，持续5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“林间追猎”首次释放时的伤害提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗中，“林间追猎”首次释放时的伤害提升至520% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","刚毅之挥"]]}